WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.350
Let’s walk through Team Dynamics.

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:04.438
Record the pattern behind the decision:

00:00:04.438 --> 00:00:07.213
leadership, decision style, friction, consensus, and

00:00:07.213 --> 00:00:08.500
the move summary.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.550
Save when the pattern materially changes or the move closes

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:13.950
, preserving your seat-scoped perspective.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:16.600
On this slide, record leadership, decision style,

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.712
friction, consensus, and a concise move summary.

00:00:19.712 --> 00:00:22.400
In practice, save when the pattern changes or the

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:23.600
move closes.

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:27.562
Your seat-scoped notes do not overwrite another Notetaker’s perspective.

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:30.935
When you are ready, use Open Team Dynamics to

00:00:30.935 --> 00:00:32.735
move to the live surface.

00:00:32.735 --> 00:00:35.460
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:35.610
.
